  "glorious-coronation.about-this-story.the-gospel-passage-is-quoted-word-for-word-from-the-douay-rh": "The Gospel passage is quoted word for word from the Douay-Rheims Bible, 1899 American Edition, which is in the public domain; verse numbers are omitted for reading aloud, and … marks skipped verses. The Our Father, Hail Mary, Glory Be and Fatima prayers follow the standard formulas used across this site. This mystery is traditionally prayed on Wednesday / Sunday.",
  "glorious-coronation.about-this-story.the-crown-of-twelve-stars-in-revelation-12-is-the-traditiona": "The crown of twelve stars in Revelation 12 is the traditional Scripture sign for this mystery; the Church celebrates Mary as Queen of heaven and earth.",
