  "glorious-coronation.frequently-asked-questio.the-coronation-of-mary-in-heaven-jesus-crowned-his-mother-as": "The Coronation of Mary. In heaven, Jesus crowned his mother as Queen of heaven and earth. This mystery is traditionally prayed on Wednesday / Sunday, and its fruit is perseverance and trust in Mary's intercession.",
